# Address Ownership

## Ownership check

Khi Buyer tao Order phai kiem tra:

\\	ext
address.user_id == current_user.id
\
- Foreign Key hop le khong dong nghia address thuoc Buyer hien tai.
- Snapshot dia chi trong Order phai duoc giu (xem order-snapshots.mdc) de dam bao lich su.
- Moi thao tac GET / PUT / DELETE / PATCH default tren address deu check ownership; neu khong khop nem *ErrorCode.ADDRESS_ACCESS_DENIED (HTTP 403).

## XOR Constraint

Bang addresses co CHECK constraint chk_address_owner_xor:

\\	ext
(user_id IS NOT NULL AND store_id IS NULL)
HOAC
(user_id IS NULL AND store_id IS NOT NULL)
\
- Address cua **Buyer** -> user_id = currentUser, store_id = NULL.
- Address **kho Store** -> store_id = currentStore, user_id = NULL.

## Single Default Address

Khi danh dau mot dia chi lam mac dinh (is_default = true), toan bo dia chi khac cung owner phai chuyen ve is_default = false. Thuc hien trong transaction.
